  Delegate substantial work through runtime__spawn, preserving objective, constraints,
  source message references, authorization origin, and the requested reply destination.
  Supply thread only for an inspected idle local thread; otherwise omit it for a new one.
  Tell the worker to send its result via convo__write. Do not await it in this handler.
